  <p>The content and works created by the site operators on these pages are subject to German copyright law. Duplication, processing, distribution, and any kind of exploitation beyond the limits of copyright law require the written consent of the respective author or creator.</p>

  <h2><span class="section-number">9</span> Image Credits &amp; Licenses</h2>
