  <p>In particular, <strong>Proxmox</strong> and <strong>Proxmox VE</strong> are registered trademarks of Proxmox Server Solutions GmbH; <strong>Ceph</strong> is a trademark of Red Hat, Inc.; <strong>LINSTOR</strong> and <strong>DRBD</strong> are trademarks of LINBIT HA-Solutions GmbH; <strong>Apple</strong>, <strong>iPhone</strong> and <strong>Apple LiDAR</strong> are trademarks of Apple Inc. Other trademarks mentioned (incl. Odoo, OVHcloud, Netcup) are the property of their respective owners.</p>
  <p>Partner and client logos are used with the respective companies' consent or as permissible reference and remain their property.</p>
</LegalLayout>
